  "exercises": [
    {
      "number": "845",
      "text": "845．分解因式：\na) $a(b+c)+3(b+c)$；\nb) $5(x-y)-y(x-y)$；\nc) $y(a-c)+5a-5c$；\nd) $z(c-d)+c-d$；\ne) $a(p-q)+p-q$；\nf) $n(c+p)+c+p$；\ng) $kx+ky-n(x+y)$；\nh) $t(s-u)-ks+ku$．",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "846",
      "text": "846．把多项式化成二项式的积：\na) $mx+my+10x+10y$；\nb) $9x+9y+ax+ay$；\nc) $7a-7b+an-bn$；\nd) $ac+bc-2a-2b$；\ne) $a^2-ab-8a+8b$；\nf) $11x+11y-x^2-xy$；\ng) $x^2+ax-a^2y-axy$；\nh) $a^2n-anx+x^2-ax$；\ni) $5a^3c+10a^2-6bc-3abc^2$；\nj) $8xy^3-24y^2-7axy+21a$．",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "847",
      "text": "847．把多项式化成二项式与三项式的积：\na) $an^2+cn^2-ap+ap^2-cp+cp^2$；\nb) $ax^2+ay^2-bx^2-by^2+b-a$；\nc) $ac^2-ad-bc^2+cd+bd-c^3$；\nd) $xy^2-by^2-ax+ab+y^2-a$．",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "848",
      "text": "848．求值：\na) $13.5\\cdot5.8-8.3\\cdot4.2-5.8\\cdot8.3+4.2\\cdot13.5$；\nb) $31\\cdot82+125\\cdot48+31\\cdot43-125\\cdot67$．",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "849",
      "text": "849．约分：\na) $\\frac{ax+ay-x-y}{2a-2}$；\nb) $\\frac{bx-b^2}{x^2-bx-x+b}$；\nc) $\\frac{xy+2y-2x-4}{(y-2)^2}$；\nd) $\\frac{(4-b)^2}{ab-4a+3b-12}$．",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "850",
      "text": "850．先分解因式，然后再求值：\na) $a^2b-b+ab^2-a$， 当 $a=-1\\frac{5}{8}$，$b=-\\frac{8}{13}$ 时；\nb) $p^2q^2+pq-q^3-p^3$， 当 $p=-1.5$，$q=-0.75$ 时；\nc) $2a+ac^2-a^2c-2c$， 当 $a=-\\frac{8}{21}$，$c=-5\\frac{1}{4}$ 时；\nd) $3x^3-2y^3-6x^2y^2+xy$，当 $x=\\frac{2}{3}$，$y=-0.5$ 时．",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "851",
      "text": "851．解方程：\na) $x(x-5)=4x-20$；\nb) $y(y+6)-7y-42=0$；\nc) $x^3-5x^2+x-5=0$；\nd) $y^4-2y^3+10y^2-20y=0$．",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "853",
      "text": "853．解方程：\na) $x^2-15x=0$；\nb) $y^2+4.5y=0$；\nc) $2x^2=3x$；\nd) $y=8y^2$．",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "854",
      "text": "854．求出下列方程的任意三组解：\na) $(x-2)(y-3)=0$；\nb) $x(y-7)=0$．",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "855",
      "text": "855．证明下列等式是恒等式：\na) $(-0.25a^3)^2=-2a^6\\cdot(-0.5)^5$；\nb) $(-0.125x^4)^4\\cdot(-2x)^{15}=(-2x^2)^3\\cdot(x^5)^5$．",
      "figure_ids": []
    }
  ],
